Feature: Generic
  This is a generic feature file that can be used to test multiple XML features.

  Scenario Outline: Basic XML SOAP request & response.
    Given HRMS_Services ( <serviceName> ) service is up and running

    Examples: 
      | serviceName                  |
      
      
      | "getAllEmployeesOnLeave10"   |
      | "getEmployeesOnLeavePerDate" |
      | "getLeaveEntryForEmployee"   |
      | "getLeaveForEmployee"        |